IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cwpa-offences`

-- Chemical Weapons (Prohibition) Act 2000, ss 2(1), 5(1), 8, 9, 12 to 14, 19, 25, 26, 27(4), 30 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_chemical-weapons-prohibition-act-2000.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2(1)`

#ASSERT `the purpose is permitted` `a Schedule 1 chemical` `research`
#ASSERT `the purpose is permitted` `a Schedule 1 chemical` `protection against toxic chemicals or chemical weapons`
#ASSERT NOT `the purpose is permitted` `a Schedule 1 chemical` `industrial`
#ASSERT NOT `the purpose is permitted` `a Schedule 1 chemical` `law enforcement including domestic riot control`
#ASSERT `the purpose is permitted` `a Schedule 2 chemical` `industrial`
#ASSERT `the purpose is permitted` `an unscheduled toxic chemical` `law enforcement including domestic riot control`
#ASSERT NOT `the purpose is permitted` `an unscheduled toxic chemical` `causing harm through toxicity`

#ASSERT NOT `the chemical is a chemical weapon` `a Schedule 3 chemical` `industrial` TRUE
#ASSERT `the chemical is a chemical weapon` `a Schedule 3 chemical` `industrial` FALSE
#ASSERT `the chemical is a chemical weapon` `a Schedule 1 chemical` `industrial` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the chemical is a chemical weapon` `a Schedule 1 chemical` `medical` TRUE

